    {
      "image": "th_48_021_235_70.png",
      "chapter": 48,
      "idx": 1964,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I'LL FIX YOUR MOM SOON."
    },
    {
      "image": "bk_22_024_334_2828.png",
      "chapter": 22,
      "idx": 159,
      "src": "bac-kiem",
      "en": "IF I WASN'T PREPARED TO DO THAT, I WOULDN'T HAVE INTERFERED IN THE FIRST PLACE."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_23_016_124_1436.png",
      "chapter": 23,
      "idx": 989,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "WITH THE TAXES SEIZED THROUGH THE BREAKDOWN OF THE ILLEGAL UNDERGROUND ECONOMY,"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_103_007_278_9883.png",
      "chapter": 103,
      "idx": 4188,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I DON'T CARE!"
    },
    {
      "image": "fresh_2384_19_012_180_3976.png",
      "chapter": 19,
      "idx": 2384,
      "src": "fresh",
      "en": "PIECE OF SHIT!!!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_152_006_325_1747.png",
      "chapter": 152,
      "idx": 6381,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "IT WAS THE SMELL OF OBUNSHI."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_173_007_58_4736.png",
      "chapter": 173,
      "idx": 7104,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "...YOU DON'T NEED TO FORCE YOURSELF TO TELL ME IF IT'S HARD."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_111_002_410_12683.png",
      "chapter": 111,
      "idx": 4503,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "QUIET DOWN..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_132_008_106_8946.png",
      "chapter": 132,
      "idx": 5516,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "THE FORMER MARQUIS SADE, THE PILLAR OF THAT HOUSE,"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_66_007_197_7145.png",
      "chapter": 66,
      "idx": 2673,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "MY NEPHEW IS ALL GROWN UP!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_136_005_177_3493.png",
      "chapter": 136,
      "idx": 5718,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I'VE SECURED A DINNER WITH THE PATRIARCH."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_100_011_287_1375.png",
      "chapter": 100,
      "idx": 4092,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "W-WE'RE SORRY!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_20_009_133_2401.png",
      "chapter": 20,
      "idx": 855,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "YOU'RE SPEAKING AS IF YOU'RE GUILTY OF THE CRIME BUT THERE'S NO EVIDENCE."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_123_006_117_8475.png",
      "chapter": 123,
      "idx": 5133,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I SHOULD TAKE THE WRAITHWOOD FIRST,"
    },
    {
      "image": "tmpt_6_007_48_11858.png",
      "chapter": 6,
      "idx": 420,
      "src": "pilot-tmpt",
      "en": "THAT'S ALRIGHT. THERE ARE OTHER OPTIONS."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_39_022_94_3972.png",
      "chapter": 39,
      "idx": 1546,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "SINCE TONIGHT IS ALSO THE NIGHT OF A FULL MOON..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_78_011_65_7310.png",
      "chapter": 78,
      "idx": 3190,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "IT'S STRANGE TO THINK THEY HAD A PAST LIKE THIS..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_50_019_226_1370.png",
      "chapter": 50,
      "idx": 2043,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "THAT'S HOW YOU CAME ABOUT."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_146_006_150_1409.png",
      "chapter": 146,
      "idx": 6078,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "THE TIME LEFT IS ABOUT HALF A YEAR..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_81_013_260_4579.png",
      "chapter": 81,
      "idx": 3319,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "THAT MEANS..."
    },
    {
      "image": "old_716_33_001_376_1169.png",
      "chapter": 33,
      "idx": 716,
      "src": "old",
      "en": "WHAT DOES THIS DUEL HAVE TO DO WITH THE 3RD TEST...?"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_185_010_118_6144.png",
      "chapter": 185,
      "idx": 7597,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "NO MATTER HOW MUCH... YOU STRUGGLE..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_186_013_62_4080.png",
      "chapter": 186,
      "idx": 7646,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "NO, WE SHOULD DO WHAT WE CAN."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_91_008_122_10920.png",
      "chapter": 91,
      "idx": 3701,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "IT'LL BE A PROBLEM IF MY BODY DOESN'T RETURN....!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_77_001_99_9208.png",
      "chapter": 77,
      "idx": 3112,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "WITH THE BASIS OF THE DISCOVERED LOCATIONS OF THE BARBARIAN TRIBE,"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_153_011_111_2159.png",
      "chapter": 153,
      "idx": 6432,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "EVEN IN THIS SITUATION, CAN YOU FORGIVE YOUR FATHER?"
    },
    {
      "image": "tmpt_7_011_90_10728.png",
      "chapter": 7,
      "idx": 488,
      "src": "pilot-tmpt",
      "en": "WHERE DID I LEAVE IT..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_17_012_367_2321.png",
      "chapter": 17,
      "idx": 742,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "THEN THAT MUST MEAN YOU KNOW A LOT ABOUT THE SITUATION HERE,"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_66_008_339_1686.png",
      "chapter": 66,
      "idx": 2675,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "YOU'RE NO DIFFERENT THAN THE BARBARIANS, TERRIER."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_148_003_300_11357.png",
      "chapter": 148,
      "idx": 6191,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I'LL BE HOSTING THE CLOSING CEREMONY."
    },
    {
      "image": "old_919_40_006_36_1123.png",
      "chapter": 40,
      "idx": 919,
      "src": "old",
      "en": "I'M GLAD WE DISCOVERED IT SO SOON."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_129_009_252_8539.png",
      "chapter": 129,
      "idx": 5410,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "HE'S HERE!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_114_007_76_9974.png",
      "chapter": 114,
      "idx": 4653,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "...BUT WHY?"
    },
    {
      "image": "fresh_2398_20_014_360_5281.png",
      "chapter": 20,
      "idx": 2398,
      "src": "fresh",
      "en": "BUT THAT WON'T WORK ANYMORE!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_62_008_153_6980.png",
      "chapter": 62,
      "idx": 2448,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "HEY, YOU! SUSPICIOUS-LOOKING GUY! COME HERE!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_154_005_196_5006.png",
      "chapter": 154,
      "idx": 6463,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "ONE DAY, HE RECEIVED A CALL FROM THE RESURRECTED RUNE."
    },
    {
      "image": "bk_7_030_231_1508.png",
      "chapter": 7,
      "idx": 73,
      "src": "bac-kiem",
      "en": "BUT IF IT'S A FIGHT YOU'RE LOOKING FOR, THEN I'LL GLADLY WELCOME IT! COME!!!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_110_007_79_8826.png",
      "chapter": 110,
      "idx": 4461,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "VIKIR! THERE'S MAIL ADDRESSED TO YOU TOO."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_46_012_152_7210.png",
      "chapter": 46,
      "idx": 1854,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I CANNOT LET A SUSPICIOUS PERSON RETURN!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_131_010_239_14470.png",
      "chapter": 131,
      "idx": 7756,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "DAMN IT... DID WE MISS THEM?"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_128_009_172_3167.png",
      "chapter": 128,
      "idx": 5365,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "HO... YOU'RE RIGHT. ABOUT ME BEING A PRIEST, AND THE COUSIN PART."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_3_010_160_1625.png",
      "chapter": 3,
      "idx": 133,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "HELLO, PATRIARCH."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_134_007_242_7308.png",
      "chapter": 134,
      "idx": 5629,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "I BELIEVE THIS EVENT HAS TRULY TAUGHT THEM ABOUT \"THE POWER OF MONEY.\""
    },
    {
      "image": "tmpt_8_013_293_9398.png",
      "chapter": 8,
      "idx": 568,
      "src": "pilot-tmpt",
      "en": "BUT THAT DOESN'T CHANGE MUCH."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_109_006_290_6705.png",
      "chapter": 109,
      "idx": 4433,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "YEAH, IT LOOKED LIKE SHE WAS FIGHTING THE NIGHT HOUND."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_113_007_277_5154.png",
      "chapter": 113,
      "idx": 4585,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "APPEAL?"
    },
    {
      "image": "old_558_23_016_37_3837.png",
      "chapter": 23,
      "idx": 558,
      "src": "old",
      "en": "MADO HOUSE QUARTERS"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_45_029_230_93.png",
      "chapter": 45,
      "idx": 1826,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "NOW, IT'S ALMOST TIME THE HOLY WATER POURS,"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_116_005_152_4236.png",
      "chapter": 116,
      "idx": 4754,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "BEFORE REGRESSION, HE WAS ONE OF THE GREAT HEROES OF THE HUMAN ALLIED FORCES."
    },
    {
      "image": "tmpt_2_006_57_9435.png",
      "chapter": 2,
      "idx": 135,
      "src": "pilot-tmpt",
      "en": "SURVEY THEM CLOSELY,"
    },
    {
      "image": "old_576_25_001_89_8786.png",
      "chapter": 25,
      "idx": 576,
      "src": "old",
      "en": "Normal Formation"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_121_015_165_9103.png",
      "chapter": 121,
      "idx": 5045,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "AND YOU CAN SENSE THINGS WITHOUT EVEN SEEING THEM."
    },
    {
      "image": "bk_62_007_233_1620.png",
      "chapter": 62,
      "idx": 269,
      "src": "bac-kiem",
      "en": "I'LL GIVE YOU A SIGNAL..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_62_001_303_5885.png",
      "chapter": 62,
      "idx": 2423,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "IT'S BEEN A WHILE SINCE I'VE BEEN HERE."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_182_010_301_4403.png",
      "chapter": 182,
      "idx": 7477,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "SO NO MATTER HOW MUCH YOU CRY AND BEG NOW, IT'S USELESS?"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_92_012_183_7306.png",
      "chapter": 92,
      "idx": 3774,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "ALRIGHT, LET'S GET READY!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_183_011_271_5287.png",
      "chapter": 183,
      "idx": 7519,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "...NONSENSE."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_135_005_273_7029.png",
      "chapter": 135,
      "idx": 5677,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "HER EXPRESSION SCREAMED TRUE HATRED AND CONTEMPT FOR SOMEONE..."
    },
