      "image": "bk_72_005_263_4839.png",
      "chapter": 72,
      "idx": 535,
      "src": "bac-kiem",
      "en": "IT TASTES GOOD."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_153_014_373_2604.png",
      "chapter": 153,
      "idx": 6444,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "IT HURTS... TOO MUCH...!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_5_008_334_4350.png",
      "chapter": 5,
      "idx": 222,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "AND MAKES THE BODY STRONGER."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_71_004_262_5444.png",
      "chapter": 71,
      "idx": 2908,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "STOP TALKING. THERE'S NO WAY THE DEAD CAN COME BACK."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_70_014_204_8364.png",
      "chapter": 70,
      "idx": 2896,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "H-HOW DO YOU KNOW THAT...?!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_15_030_79_181.png",
      "chapter": 15,
      "idx": 666,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "COINCIDENCE...?"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_88_002_215_648.png",
      "chapter": 88,
      "idx": 3548,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "SO HOW WAS MY ACTING,"
    },
    {
      "image": "fresh_2555_30_003_100_3684.png",
      "chapter": 30,
      "idx": 2555,
      "src": "fresh",
      "en": "MADO HOUSE INDIVIDUAL TRAINING ROOM"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_41_007_331_2721.png",
      "chapter": 41,
      "idx": 1624,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "MEANS THAT THEIR ALLIANCE IS STILL STRONG."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_151_004_97_6418.png",
      "chapter": 151,
      "idx": 6326,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "AND DURING A SABBATICAL, TO HEAL THE AFTEREFFECTS OF MY CHRONIC ILLNESS,"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_185_002_220_9708.png",
      "chapter": 185,
      "idx": 7573,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "VIKIR... REALLY ESCAPED THE TOWER...!"
    },
    {
      "image": "tmpt_6_007_24_10861.png",
      "chapter": 6,
      "idx": 418,
      "src": "pilot-tmpt",
      "en": "- CANNOT BE MASTERED BECAUSE OF YOUR INJURY. -"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_185_004_489_8321.png",
      "chapter": 185,
      "idx": 7580,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "MY DAUGHTER!!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_99_003_230_9946.png",
      "chapter": 99,
      "idx": 4058,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "LAST QUESTION."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_177_003_146_7310.png",
      "chapter": 177,
      "idx": 7252,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "BUT I HAVE NO INTENTION OF STAYING IN THE TREE OF FALLING INDEFINITELY BECAUSE OF THAT AMBITION."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_38_025_362_3261.png",
      "chapter": 38,
      "idx": 1502,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "WHAT IS UNFAIR?!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_86_004_154_10623.png",
      "chapter": 86,
      "idx": 3480,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "Lead us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil..."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_155_015_120_3474.png",
      "chapter": 155,
      "idx": 6520,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "AND BECOME SACRIFICES FOR THE \"AGE OF DESTRUCTION\"!"
    },
    {
      "image": "th_116_017_108_2483.png",
      "chapter": 116,
      "idx": 4797,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "HOHO, THAT'S RIGHT."
    },
    {
      "image": "th_142_002_134_2434.png",
      "chapter": 142,
      "idx": 5828,
      "src": "th",
      "en": "THAT WAS WHEN I REALIZED"
    },
    {
      "image": "fresh_2645_42_003_294_6646.png",
      "chapter": 42,
      "idx": 2645,
      "src": "fresh",
      "en": "NO ONE WAS ABLE TO FIND OUT WHO SHE WAS."
